---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'; import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro'; import TrustNote from '../components/TrustNote.astro'; import { organization } from '../data/organization';
---
<MainLayout title="Transparency" description="Review the available identity and verification information for Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Transparency"><section class="section shell"><SectionHeading title="Trust begins with a clear record." text="We publish what has been supplied, label what is reported and keep unconfirmed information out of official claims." /><SectionHeading eyebrow="Organizational identity" title="The foundation, clearly identified." text="The details below reflect information supplied to the foundation's public record. They are not presented as independent government verification." /><div class="content-list" style="margin-top:55px"><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">Supplied by the foundation</span><h2>Foundation name</h2><p>{organization.name}</p><h2>CIN (as supplied by the foundation)</h2><p>{organization.identity.cin.value}</p><p>The CIN above remains subject to official registry verification.</p></article><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">Supplied by the foundation</span><h2>Address</h2><p>{organization.address}</p><h2>Contact email</h2><p><a href={`mailto:${organization.email}`}>{organization.email}</a></p></article></div><div class="content-list" style="margin-top:24px"><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">Pending verification</span><h2>Section 8 licence</h2><p>{organization.identity.section8License.value}</p><p>Supporting documentation is not currently published.</p></article></div><TrustNote>The CIN shown above is the most recent value supplied by the foundation and is not represented as independently verified. The Section 8 licence and address remain pending confirmation until supporting documentation is available.</TrustNote><div class="prose" style="margin-top:75px"><h2>Documents</h2><p>No annual reports, financial statements, certificates or activity reports have been supplied for publication yet. We will add authentic documents with their title, publication date and source once available.</p></div></section></MainLayout>
